00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:18.600
It's definitely been a really full summer.

00:00:18.680 --> 00:00:20.840
I know for many people, I've been just hearing from a lot of people,

00:00:20.940 --> 00:00:22.360
a lot of different things going on,

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:24.460
and hopefully there are great memories from that.

00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:28.120
I know for myself, I had some great memories here with our church family together,

00:00:28.280 --> 00:00:30.740
things like serving together side by side early this summer,

00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:32.720
as we had like a work day together,

00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:35.240
or some of our times just gathering in worship.

