00:28:43.040 --> 00:28:49.020
required to be strong, to be able to live out God's purpose and calling for our lives. That's looked a

00:28:49.020 --> 00:28:52.740
lot of different ways. I don't know if you remember when we started Deep and Wide as a theme, we

00:28:52.740 --> 00:28:57.040
shared this idea of spiritual surface tension, right? Kind of like if you're, you know, many of

00:28:57.040 --> 00:29:00.680
