00:29:08.200 --> 00:29:13.820
those deeper areas that maybe we're afraid of, maybe we feel like are too big for us.

00:29:14.180 --> 00:29:15.320
It's the inner prison stuff.

00:29:15.400 --> 00:29:16.320
It's the exile stuff.

00:29:16.420 --> 00:29:18.840
It's the stuff that we can't row our way across.

00:29:19.140 --> 00:29:22.820
That spiritual surface tension keeps us from going there.

00:29:22.820 --> 00:29:25.420
