00:29:25.420 --> 00:29:31.920
but I've been so thankful to see our church take on that challenge and say, yes, we're going to go

00:29:31.920 --> 00:29:36.920
deeper. And some of that has been through just regular daily stuff. Like about a year and a half

00:29:36.920 --> 00:29:42.580
