store for us. Can we look ahead with eyes of faith? Say, God, we're going to worship you

00:42:48.890 --> 00:42:55.030
just based on your promise. Not because we see it yet, not because it makes sense to us,

00:42:55.430 --> 00:43:00.130
not because we feel like we can row our boats to it, but God, we're going to raise those sails.

00:43:00.870 --> 00:43:02.810
God, we're gonna look to the promise that you have,

00:43:02.870 --> 00:43:04.850
that you want your people

00:43:04.850 --> 00:43:08.670
to bring the nations home into that tent.

00:43:09.290 --> 00:43:11.330
God, you wanna see more people being set free

00:43:11.330 --> 00:43:13.110
and brought to salvation and healing,

00:43:13.490 --> 00:43:15.010
their lives transformed by the gospel

00:43:15.010 --> 00:43:16.870
so they can then go and transform the world.

00:43:17.190 --> 00:43:18.630
God, we get to be a part of that.

00:43:18.670 --> 00:43:20.830
It's a privilege, it's a joy, it's an honor.

00:43:20.950 --> 00:43:22.290
And yeah, sometimes we get tired.

00:43:22.870 --> 00:43:24.410
And sometimes there's even discouragement

00:43:24.410 --> 00:43:26.270
or struggle along the path.

00:43:26.670 --> 00:43:28.550
But God, help us to keep raising those sails,

00:43:28.850 --> 00:43:29.810
to keep going deeper,

00:43:30.130 --> 00:43:31.750
to keep reaching out to the nations together.
